meta {
  name: Events - Calendar file - Draft
  type: http
  seq: 203
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of an events space>/events/<cuid of a draft that you host>/calendar-file
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: text/calendar
}

docs {
  A draft has no calendar file (#1515): its host, the owner and the admins get 422, "This event is a draft. It has no calendar file.", as the JSON error of the API. The other members get 404, the body of an event that does not exist.
}
